
- Affected when the player is equipping, drinking, identifying, or managing physical items
  and gear. Routine item use (drawing a weapon in combat) may not need mechanics.
- Casting a spell the character knows or has prepared is NOT an inventory action, even if
  a matching rule (e.g. wand_and_scroll_use) appears in the rules manifest. Spell effects
  belong to the domain they affect (combat, traversal, exploration, etc.).
- Only flag wand_and_scroll_use when the player explicitly references activating a physical
  item ("I use my wand of…", "I read the scroll of…", "I drink the potion").
